    },
    {
      "text": "Not just the invariant failed, but the invariant failed because the algorithm made a decision from a stale view of the world.",
      "timestamp_sec": 895,
      "why": "shows the granularity of feedback an agent needs on distributed bugs"
    },
    {
      "text": "The agent does not just learn that the system is wrong, it learns why the system is wrong.",
      "timestamp_sec": 951,
      "why": "the payoff claim for the whole tracing approach"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deterministic simulation lets agents participate in the design, not just in the implementation.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1009,
      "why": "the talk's conclusion about where agents can move"
    },
    {
      "text": "The prompt is the platform and the specification is the product.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1009,
      "why": "the title thesis in final form"
    }
